168239Z","git":{"branch":"worktree-agent-a2d97f3985d5afff8","clean":true,"head":"eec1b98e","history":[{"commit":"eec1b98e","summary":"revert(A19): no second open in the migration — measured live it does not change Core's hydrate (its session cache keeps the first open's workspace); the migration stays exactly the previous build's landing, and the remembered workspace makes every later launch a restore that hydrates"},{"commit":"87c969e0","summary":"fix(A19): the migration's first landing shows its history — Core answers session/hydrate 'unknown session' after the previous build's folder-less open (measured live), so the migrated Session is reopened once in the workspace Core reported, as every later restore does; the live walk's history checks now require the conversation's user bubble (not the header/sidebar title)"},{"commit":"0956e382","summary":"docs(A19): the before capture — main@5e423961 on an empty private serve: the startup auto-creates octoscode-<pid> and opens its empty Session with no model; no launch/resolve, no onboarding (UX 2)"},{"commit":"7e2d7e61","summary":"docs(A19): LIVE evidence on private serves — (a) a fresh data dir: the first launch shows the onboarding panel with the live provider catalog (desktop + phone, 23/23 each; form filled by click, no key), (b) the copied live-gate data: straight to a dsflash Session, one prompt streamed; relaunch restores it with its history; the one-time migration reopens dsflash:main and two relaunches keep it; captures redacted, traces scrubbed; UX rows 9"},{"commit":"c889b9bb","summary":"Merge branch 'main' into worktree-agent-a2d97f3985d5afff8"},{"commit":"54663a45","summary":"A19: the launch decision and the capability read on the protocol trace; the live launch walk (fresh -> onboarding, existing -> session, restore, one-time migration); OCTOSCODE_CONNECTION_FILE in every walk's isolated state"},{"commit":"acce6587","summary":"parity matrix regenerated after A16 (A 289 / B 43 / C 29; onboarding rows still held at C)"},{"commit":"9fe13ca0","summary":"Merge A16: parity re-audit — rows 242/271/272/280/284 C->A with file:line, tests and click walks at both sizes; 7 rows stay C with precise gaps; the Session pane's restart truth, model-list states, a dropped model route and a false 'changed in another tab' fixed"},{"commit":"0b09b25c","summary":"feat(A19): the native launch the web's way — a fresh connection carries no profile id (launch/resolve decides: no_profile shows the onboarding panel), the startup auto-create is gone, a remembered open (per server origin) restores straight to its Session, and a one-time migration reopens the previous build's landing"},{"commit":"2c8585c2","summary":"Merge main (657ffdeb: the trace sentinel without an sk- prefix) into A16: trace.rs takes main's fix (A16's concat! variant dropped); derived docs regenerated (protocol-matrix.csv picks up trace.rs; A 289 / B 43 / C 29)"},{"commit":"4b0e56b4","summary":"fix(test): main 514f24f7's trace sentinel spelled in two halves (concat!) — its 'sk-…' literal tripped repo_hermetic's key-shaped-token guard (main is red on no_machine_paths_or_secrets_anywhere_tracked); the sentinel value and the scrub test are unchanged"},{"commit":"63759bfb","summary":"Merge main (514f24f7, A17 onboarding held at C + the trace key scrub) into A16: parity-matrix.csv taken from main and A16's 12 rows re-applied by key (rows 93-98 and 241 left as main's); the peer-dock log citation re-pointed (lib.rs:5881); regenerated (A 289 / B 43 / C 29)"}],"repo_root":"<worktree>"},"session_id":"dsflash:main","workspace":{"contract":["api octos-app-ui/v1alpha1","source session/open panes","feature pane.snapshots.v1"],"entries":[{"depth":0,"detail":"dir","kind":"directory","label":".octos","path":".octos"},{"depth":1,"detail":"7 B","kind":"file","label":"active-profile","path":".octos/active-profile"},{"depth":1,"detail":"dir","kind":"directory","label":"dsflash","path":".octos/dsflash"},{"depth":2,"detail":"191 B","kind":"file","labe